{"4326030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ultimate Wizard", "steam_appid": 4326030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/76dd82545dcdf0d8b63e9590785d98b7.poster.avif?t=1787651677\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/76dd82545dcdf0d8b63e9590785d98b7.webm?t=1787651677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/76dd82545dcdf0d8b63e9590785d98b7.mp4?t=1787651677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find and augment your spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spells that you find are permanently yours, whilst augments are only available in a run. Equip the right spells and banish, skip and re-roll augments to get the right one for your build. Swap out augments between spells at any time and make your character overpowered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/254a572dbcc86e137dc731979fe8870d.poster.avif?t=1787651677\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/254a572dbcc86e137dc731979fe8870d.webm?t=1787651677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/254a572dbcc86e137dc731979fe8870d.mp4?t=1787651677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up your spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy enemies and grab crystals to level up, pick the best spell from the upgrade offers to empower and open chests to find new gear. Augments are random and come in a variety of rarity tiers, making every run unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/e6a395aa375eb41cb087f708239bcb68.poster.avif?t=1787651677\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/e6a395aa375eb41cb087f708239bcb68.webm?t=1787651677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/e6a395aa375eb41cb087f708239bcb68.mp4?t=1787651677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become the Ultimate Wizard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open item chests to find new build defining items, getting lucky with a legendary item could allow your build to become game-breaking overpowered. Scout out the map to find temporary and permanent buffs to your wizard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/391ab1acc8d22868eb6264b039560d72.poster.avif?t=1787651677\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/391ab1acc8d22868eb6264b039560d72.webm?t=1787651677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/391ab1acc8d22868eb6264b039560d72.mp4?t=1787651677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-firing of all spells.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the maps and uncover secrets that temporarily or permanently empower you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ unique spells for all your needs, from projectiles to AoE storms to minions, there's something for everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ augments for your spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ build defining items. Spread ignites to nearby enemies, get additional boss minions, convert all your frost damage to electric, it's all here.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/76dd82545dcdf0d8b63e9590785d98b7.poster.avif?t=1787651677\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/76dd82545dcdf0d8b63e9590785d98b7.webm?t=1787651677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/76dd82545dcdf0d8b63e9590785d98b7.mp4?t=1787651677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find and augment your spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spells that you find are permanently yours, whilst augments are only available in a run. Equip the right spells and banish, skip and re-roll augments to get the right one for your build. Swap out augments between spells at any time and make your character overpowered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/254a572dbcc86e137dc731979fe8870d.poster.avif?t=1787651677\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/254a572dbcc86e137dc731979fe8870d.webm?t=1787651677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/254a572dbcc86e137dc731979fe8870d.mp4?t=1787651677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up your spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy enemies and grab crystals to level up, pick the best spell from the upgrade offers to empower and open chests to find new gear. Augments are random and come in a variety of rarity tiers, making every run unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/e6a395aa375eb41cb087f708239bcb68.poster.avif?t=1787651677\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/e6a395aa375eb41cb087f708239bcb68.webm?t=1787651677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/e6a395aa375eb41cb087f708239bcb68.mp4?t=1787651677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become the Ultimate Wizard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open item chests to find new build defining items, getting lucky with a legendary item could allow your build to become game-breaking overpowered. Scout out the map to find temporary and permanent buffs to your wizard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/391ab1acc8d22868eb6264b039560d72.poster.avif?t=1787651677\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/391ab1acc8d22868eb6264b039560d72.webm?t=1787651677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/extras/391ab1acc8d22868eb6264b039560d72.mp4?t=1787651677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-firing of all spells.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the maps and uncover secrets that temporarily or permanently empower you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ unique spells for all your needs, from projectiles to AoE storms to minions, there's something for everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ augments for your spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ build defining items. Spread ignites to nearby enemies, get additional boss minions, convert all your frost damage to electric, it's all here.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Destroy thousands of enemies and grow in power in this fantasy roguelite survivor. Find spells and augment them, equip build defining items, discover secrets, level up and set out to become the ultimate wizard!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/603dfdbbdd3e38ccf87b25caee1ca20be30180a0/header.jpg?t=1787651677", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/98418844917c3529b57bc27d1e324dd6a5dbce98/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787651677", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326030/98418844917c3529b57bc27d1e324dd6a5dbce98/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787651677", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"